# Golden system prompts are compared byte-for-byte by smoke Layer J.
#
# This machine has core.autocrlf=true, so without this rule git would hand back
# CRLF on checkout while buildSystemPrompt emits LF - and every golden check
# would fail on a fresh clone here while staying green on Linux CI, which
# defaults to autocrlf=false. A platform-dependent failure in the one test whose
# whole job is detecting unexplained differences is the worst possible place for
# one, so the line endings are pinned rather than left to local config.
test/fixtures/*.txt text eol=lf
